<title>RUSSIA: Russia's GUM shareholders' meeting Apr 25.</title>
<headline>Russia's GUM shareholders' meeting Apr 25.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's biggest retailer OAO Torgovy Dom GUM will hold its annual shareholders' meeting on April 25, a GUM official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The head of investor relations told Reuters that the company's 1996 results were not yet ready and would be provided by the time of the shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>GUM's net profit in the first three quarters of 1996 was 133.39 billion roubles, according to Russian accounting standards, compared to 94.04 billion roubles in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
